<page>
{ "title": "Welcome to Tessera" }
</page>

<script>
// Data from an API: one line. app/apis/default.ts says which server.
const devices = get('/objects')
</script>

<template>
  <main class="root">
    <section class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Design-system-first</p>
      <h1 class="title">Build interfaces from a system you can trust</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Your tokens and components live in <code>system/</code>. The compiler checks every
        style and every component use, so the design system holds as the app grows.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <Button tone="primary" size="lg" @press="counter.bump()">Clicked {counter.count} times</Button>
        <Button tone="neutral" emphasis="outline" size="lg">Edit app/pages/index.tess</Button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="terminal" aria-label="Example">
      <p class="line"><span class="prompt">$</span> npx tessera check</p>
      <p class="line out">0 errors, 0 warnings in 5 files.</p>
      <p class="line"><span class="prompt">$</span> npm run dev</p>
      <p class="line out">This app, and the docs for its design system, each on its own address.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="features">
      <div class="feature">
        <h2 class="name">Design tokens</h2>
        <p class="body">Colors, spacing, type and shadows, written as tokens you own and can change.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <h2 class="name">Light and dark</h2>
        <p class="body">Components use meaning (surface, text, action), so a theme switch changes everything at once.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <h2 class="name">Checked at compile time</h2>
        <p class="body">A value off the scale, or a variant that does not exist, is an error with the fix suggested.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <h2 class="name">Docs that stay current</h2>
        <p class="body">Run <code>npm run dev</code> and open the docs address: every component and token, generated from the system.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="data" aria-labelledby="data-title">
      <h2 class="name" id="data-title">Data from an API</h2>
      <p class="body">
        <code>get('/objects')</code> in this page's script lists the devices below, from
        <code>app/apis/default.ts</code>. Loading, errors and refreshing are handled.
      </p>
      <p class="body" if="devices.loading">Loading...</p>
      <p class="body" else-if="devices.error">Could not load the devices: {devices.error.message}</p>
      <ul class="devices" else>
        <li class="device" each="device in devices.data" key="device.id">
          <span class="id">{device.id}</span> {device.name}
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <p class="note">Edit this page and save: it updates without a reload.</p>
  </main>
</template>

